@node Overview, Installation, Top, Top
@chapter Overview of @code{Zebra}

Today TCP/IP network is covering all over the world.  The Internet has
deployed many countries and companies.  If you are connecting to the
Internet or using TCP/IP LAN network, you will need IP Routing.

@code{GNU Zebra} is a free software which provides Distributed Routing
System.  It includes many protocol specific daemons.  @code{RIPd}
handles RIP protocol. @code{OSPFd} is off course a daemon which supports
OSPF version 2 described in RFC2178.  @code{BGPd} daemon supports BGP-4
protocol described in RFC1771 (A Border Gateway Protocal 4).
@code{zebra} is routing manager and it dose kernel routing table
management.

