@chapter OSPFd

OSPFd will provide OSPF version 2 routing protocol which described at
RFC2178.  Currently OSPFd is under development.  Next version of
@code{zebra} will contain OSPFd.

If you are interested in developing OSPFd please contact to
@email{takada@@zebra.org}.

