@section BGPd longfile format

BGPd outputs logs into terminal or a specified file.  It includes routing
updates and peer status change information.  It includes date, time,
packet sort:[peer IP address] routing information.

@example
97/08/25 17:42:18 Update:[202.216.226.1] 130.58.0.0/16 med: 0 lpref: 0 nexthop: 202.216.226.1 aspath: 4691 3561 5119 3576 3782 i
@end example

